        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 30 · AI Job Application Screener\nScores CVs against the job description, summarises strengths/gaps and fast-tracks strong candidates.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/job-screener` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"candidate\": \"Neha Gupta\",\n \"email\": \"neha@example.com\",\n \"role\": \"Senior Backend Engineer\",\n \"job_description\": \"5+ yrs Node.js, Postgres, AWS...\",\n \"resume_text\": \"Paste resume text here...\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
